  "description": "In the wealthy and powerful Bae Deok Lee clan, Ji-Hye, the youngest daughter-in-law and newlywed of three months, burns with ambition to make her husband the eldest son and become the head of the clan. On the eve of the Shinrye ceremony, where couples are forbidden from having sex to purify their bodies, Ji-Hye's twin brother burrows between her legs.\n\n *\"Not from behind. Please, my lord.\"\n\n\"That hole looks like it would make you want to shove something in it. It seems like it would be easy to get pregnant. You have the makings of a head of the clan.\"*\n\nThe beginning of a fatal relationship entangled with family, taboo, and desire!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
